SY_TALK("jIhi_dxuKy4",[[0,["He was son of God and He came on this Earth","with a very great message that you are to"]],[10,["be resurrected."]],[12,["It is not only that you have to maintain yourself,","and you don’t eat this and don’t do that"]],[24,["and all those Ten Commandments, but He came","to give us a message of our rebirth."]],[32,["We are to be born again; not by any just a","ritual or some sort of a ceremony we go through,"]],[40,["but there has to be something living that","has to take place."]],[49,["He has always talked about [the] living God."]],[52,["So something living must happen and what happens","when it is something living?"]],[57,["When it is something living we start finding","the transformation taking place."]],[65,["For example: you sow a seed and the living","process starts; the tree starts transforming"]],[70,["into the root and a shoot; and then the shoot","start transforming itself into leaves and"]],[82,["then into fruits."]],[84,["It’s not static: not that we take one piece","from here and keep it there and it is transformed,"]],[94,["but there is something that happens within,","something very spontaneous which brings forth"]],[106,["this transformation and you see it with your","own eyes."]],[112,["And this transformation has to take place","within you."]],[114,["Now, in a case as I told you of Cathy or someone","like that one can say all right you must have"]],[125,["consoled or you give her love and this and","that she be consoled, but that’s not the"]],[129,["point."]],[130,["As I told you there are many people who have","got everything, still they are unhappy."]],[141,["And if you ask them they will say, “No,","we don’t know."]],[148,["We are not happy."]],[149,["We don’t feel happy."]],[150,["There’s no joy in our lives."]],[151,["We have lost our heart.\""]],[152,["They can’t explain but it is there."]],[155,["What have they lost?"]],[159,["The time has come for the whole world to know","their Spirit."]],[173,["This is the time which is prophesised even","by William Blake where he describes England"]],[179,["is the Jerusalem."]],[182,["The time has come for you to know your Spirit."]],[188,["That has to happen."]],[190,["It’s not a thing by which I tell you, you","stand on your heads or hold your nose or start"]],[197,["taking some names, like a one track mind going","on chanting some names like madcaps."]],[202,["It’s not that, but something that must happen","within yourself and that must transform you."]],[212,["Of course, one must understand [that] if it","is a living process, you cannot pay for it."]],[221,["How can you pay for a seed to sprout?"]],[225,["The seed doesn’t understand; the living","process doesn’t understand money."]],[231,["It’s the dead work of human beings."]],[236,["How can you organise it also?"]],[239,["You cannot! It’s spontaneous."]],[240,["There is no technique."]],[241,["It’s all built-in."]],[242,["The technique is built: in the little seed","that you see, the whole technique of its growth"]],[246,["is built-in."]],[247,["The technique is built-in and all its maps,","how it is going to be, what tree it is going"]],[253,["to be, how the tree is going to grow, in what","height, in what thickness, everything is inside"]],[263,["that seed."]],[266,["In the same way it is a spontaneous thing,","which has to happen within you and if it is"]],[274,["so we have to find out."]],[276,["That’s how the search started: people went","to India, went all over the places to find"]],[281,["out."]],[282,["They thought we cannot find the solution here","let us go up there."]],[284,["It has to be that way, because if you grow","too much outside you have to find out your"]],[294,["roots."]],[295,["Because you develop that fear that you may","not be able to sustain this outward growth"]],[304,["unless and until you find out the depth or","the source on which this is to be sustained."]],[313,["So people started searching and searching."]],[315,["I have met many of them, many thousands, and","I find they were misled many a times."]],[324,["They were really misled."]],[326,["They were so anxious to get to it that whatever","somebody said they just accepted blindfolded."]],[334,["People asked for money, all right take money."]],[339,["They starved themselves, collected money and","gave this to these swindlers and these cheats"]],[347,["and thugs."]],[349,["How can anybody exchange money for the Spirit?"]],[357,["It’s absurd! It’s illogical."]],[360,["But we understand money to such a great extent,","I was amazed, that we think that Spirit can"]],[368,["be bought by giving some money to someone,","or some sort of a material thing."]],[376,["Logically all these things have to be understood."]],[385,["Now to say that logically you cannot understand","God, is wrong."]],[394,["You can, logically; not rationally but logically."]],[397,["There’s a difference between the two."]],[398,["For example, if you have not come to London,","you have not seen London, I have not been"]],[403,["to Newbury, I did not know it’s a beautiful","place like this, then I cannot understand"]],[405,["it."]],[406,["But if I have come here, then I see with my","own eyes, “Yes it is so.\""]],[418,["Then I have to say, “Yes I have seen it."]],[423,["It’s so.\""]],[424,["I have seen it, I have felt it."]],[429,["I know it is so."]],[431,["Then it becomes, the whole thing becomes logical."]],[433,["But rationally if I sit in India somewhere","in the corner and think of Newbury, “Now"]],[437,["I am going to Newbury.\""]],[441,["Just putting my wings of imagination outside:","will I come to Newbury?"]],[450,["But if I come, this is very important to understand,","if I come here, actually I come here, in person,"]],[460,["then I know the place and I know the people","of Newbury and I know it."]],[468,["That means it has to be an actualisation."]],[473,["If it is not an actualisation then whatever","you decide about it, this way or that, way"]],[480,["is absolutely illogical, because you have","not been there; very simple as that."]],[483,["Some people say, “We believe in God.\""]],[485,["Some people say, “We don’t believe in","God.\""]],[488,["Both ways, whatever they are saying, they","are doing it I don’t know how."]],[494,["If they believe in God, maybe it’s innately","built in us to believe in God."]],[501,["But even they don’t believe in God, it’s","all right, because they don’t understand;"]],[509,["they have not been there."]],[512,["But you must keep yourself open: open to understand","that if something has to happen to us, which"]],[526,["is a living process, some transformation has","to take place within us."]],[534,["It has to be an actualisation, not a lecture","to you or a sermon to you, or some sort of"]],[541,["a service and then you disperse."]],[545,["You must start feeling some transformation","coming within."]],[554,["In the Bible itself, it is written: “I will","appear before you like tongues of flames.\""]],[561,["Nobody can explain what it is like; they cannot."]],[568,["It is written that: “The Tree of Life will","be fed by the water of life.\""]],[581,["It’s a prophecy."]],[582,["Now what is Tree of Life?"]],[584,["Where is it?"]],[586,["Where does it exist within us?"]],[590,["Nobody has tried to find out."]],[593,["They say, “You must have faith.\""]],[596,["“Yes, whatever is said is true."]],[598,["You must have faith.\""]],[601,["But if you have faith, after some time you","will be disillusioned."]],[608,["That’s blind, absolutely blind."]],[611,["Because where is that Tree of Life, you have","not seen, felt or it has not manifested."]],[619,["For this we can refer to other scriptures","also, specially in India where people have"]],[628,["been more meditative."]],[629,["As you have been more outward and seeking","[the] overpowering of matter, in India people"]],[639,["tried to find out what’s happening within."]],[644,["I mean there are genuine people also, not","all are thugs."]],[649,["They are not in the market."]],[652,["They are hiding themselves somewhere in Himalayas","and all these places."]],[656,["But in the sixth century only, we have the","description of The Tree of Life."]],[664,["And the Tree of Life is shown here as you","see."]],[667,["Now you are not to have blind faith in what","I am saying, there’s no need."]],[677,["But you should not also deny me."]],[681,["You should try to understand what I am saying","and see for yourself [if] it works out or"]],[690,["not."]],[691,["If it does not work out we give another chance","to you."]],[694,["Because you must know that I have come here","to give you something, not take anything from"]],[705,["you."]],[706,["I cannot take, that’s my nature."]],[710,["That’s how God has made me."]],[713,["It’s something funny, but I cannot take","anything."]],[718,["If I have come to give you then there’s","nothing selling, there’s no shop."]],[727,["Try! If you should be open it would help you","better to understand what I am trying to tell"]],[735,["you."]],[736,["Here now, you see the Tree of Life (chakra","chart) and when this Tree of Life is given"]],[747,["the water of life then what happens?"]],[751,["How the nourishment reaches?"]],[754,["And how it starts activating?"]],[758,["It is as simple as connecting this machine","to the mains."]],[763,["Any machine, say a television is there, once","it is connected to the mains you can see the"]],[773,["manifestation of the machine very clearly."]],[775,["And you are amazed [that] for a villager,","if you show, that he is surprised, and he"]],[782,["cannot understand how this is happening, how","are these pictures coming, from where these"]],[786,["music is coming, how these colours have been","shown."]],[790,["He can’t understand it."]],[792,["In the same way, once your machine becomes","connected, connected, with the Divine you"]],[808,["start finding Its manifestation."]],[814,["Now in this picture we have shown you here","the subtle being that exists within us: just"]],[825,["like a structure of a seed you can say."]],[828,["As in the seed there is a primule of the germinating","power."]],[835,["In the same way, in that triangular bone is","the power which is going to give us rebirth."]],[852,["This is your own."]],[854,["This is your Mother who is going to give you","your rebirth."]],[860,["She exists in all of us."]],[865,["She is dormant, but She knows everything about","you."]],[869,["She is like a tape recorder."]],[871,["She knows all your past and She knows your","seeking and She knows you value."]],[875,["She knows your defects and She knows what","mistakes you have committed, who has troubled"]],[882,["you and who has looted you, and who has deceived","you."]],[886,["She knows everything."]],[888,["But She is dormant."]],[889,["She lies there in a dormant stage and She","is called as ‘Kundalini’ in the Sanskrit"]],[897,["language."]],[898,["Kundalini is the word [which] comes from the","coiled."]],[904,["The word ‘Kundalini’ means ‘the coil’."]],[907,["And She is in three and a half coils, coiled","together, and just like, they call it like"]],[915,["a serpent, She is lying down there."]],[918,["But you have seen mostly, most of the energies","are kept in a coil, because if any chord has"]],[929,["to be used we put it in a coil always."]],[932,["The one end has to come out so it is kept","coiled up there."]],[936,["Why this three and half is also a big mathematics","which, of course later on, you can find out"]],[944,["what is the meaning of this three and half","coils."]],[949,["Just now, I will just give you a very, very","short description, an outline, about this"]],[959,["power that resides within us."]],[961,["It resides in the triangular bone called as","sacrum."]],[965,["That is at the back of us, our backbone, at","the lowest point."]],[973,["You can see there is a triangular bone behind."]],[976,["Now see this is called as sacrum."]],[978,["Sacrum means ‘sacred bone’."]],[979,["It has been found out that when the human","body burns this bone does not burn."]],[988,["That is why they call it sacrum long time","back."]],[991,["But the reason is the Kundalini is inside","that bone."]],[994,["Now above that, you find there are six centres:","one, two, three, four, five and six."]],[1006,["And the lowest one is below that."]],[1011,["All these centres are subtle centres which","manifest outside our plexuses, the physical"]],[1021,["plexuses that we know of."]],[1023,["These centres exist as energy pockets and","they supply the two lines: you see the blue"]],[1037,["and the yellow line."]],[1040,["They try to balance and arrange the power","to flow into these two channels."]],[1051,["These two channels represent within us, on","the left hand side, the one which comes as"]],[1061,["the blue line which you see comes actually","from the right side on top and comes down"]],[1074,["and meets the first centre there."]],[1078,["This is the line of Ida channel which controls","our emotional line."]],[1085,["It controls our past and is also called as","moon line."]],[1092,["It is, it represents our desiring power, our","desiring power."]],[1098,["The another line you see is the yellow line","which represents our power of action, through"]],[1110,["which we act."]],[1112,["First we desire, we want to have something","and then we act."]],[1117,["So this line represents your physical and","mental being which goes in the front side"]],[1128,["and the left side of the brain and forms the","ego, which is a by-product of our activities"]],[1141,["for our actions."]],[1144,["The first power of desire or the emotional","power, when it acts, for example say Cathy"]],[1153,["was emotionally disturbed: her this power","was acting too much and was using all the"]],[1160,["power from all the body and was creating a","superego there."]],[1167,["So actually on the left hand side and in the","front is the ego and on the right hand side"]],[1178,["and the back is the superego, covering our","limbic area which is in the brain above this"]],[1188,["centre."]],[1189,["This centre, Agnya, is the centre of Christ."]],[1196,["Christ resides there."]],[1197,["People say Christ is within us."]],[1200,["Where is He?"]],[1201,["Which part?"]],[1202,["Where is He placed?"]],[1205,["He is placed in this centre."]],[1207,["Now when I say that He is placed in there,","we can prove it."]],[1210,["It can easily proved, because when the Kundalini","rises and if She stops at that centre — which"]],[1216,["you can see and feel it, that it has stopped","there — you have to take the name of Christ"]],[1223,["and request Him that, “Please allow the","Kundalini to pass.\""]],[1226,["If He is awakened, of course, that can only","be done by a person who is a realised-soul."]],[1234,["Any Dick, Tom, Harry cannot do it: you cannot","call Christ or anyone because what is the"]],[1241,["right you have got?"]],[1242,["There has to be a protocol, a connection by","which you can call Him."]],[1249,["Any such person when he calls Christ, He can","be awakened and the Kundalini rises from there:"]],[1258,["that’s how you know this is the centre of","Christ."]],[1264,["What is the mantra of this centre?"]],[1269,["Surprisingly, it is our, Lord’s prayer."]],[1272,["It’s the mantra."]],[1274,["It’s not only the Lord’s prayer, it’s","a mantra for this centre."]],[1280,["And the weapon of Christ is forgiveness."]],[1285,["When the Kundalini stops here, that means","you think too much."]],[1290,["Imagine all the Christians, or I can say the","Christian nations, think too much."]],[1299,["It’s surprising! We should not think at","all."]],[1303,["I mean Christ has done that for us."]],[1304,["We are not supposed to think."]],[1307,["But we think about everything, we plan about","everything."]],[1310,["We are mad with thinking."]],[1312,["I mean, it grows like a mad weed."]],[1314,["I was in Switzerland, there was a doctor who","came to see me and he said, “Mother, you"]],[1321,["can cut my neck or you can break my teeth,","do what you like but stop my thinking!”"]],[1328,["He just could not stop thinking."]],[1332,["What is the solution for this thinking in","Sahaja Yoga is you have to forgive."]],[1339,["You have to forgive."]],[1341,["If you forgive, then this centre can be resolved."]],[1346,["But forgiveness is just a myth, because what","are you doing?"]],[1354,["If you are troubled by another person, if","you do not forgive that person, that person"]],[1361,["is successful."]],[1362,["Because you go on worrying about it, crying","about it, weeping about it, and whatever he"]],[1369,["wanted to trouble you for, you are just a","complete proof of it."]],[1375,["So forgiveness means what?"]],[1378,["What you are doing is to get rid of his power","over you."]],[1383,["And this is what Christ has said that, “Forgive”","and the greatest thing He did on the cross"]],[1389,["was to say that, “Forgive.\""]],[1393,["Because these people really committed the","real crime of crucifying the Son of God."]],[1400,["But still He said, “Forgive for they do","not know what they are doing”."]],[1405,["They do not know what they are doing, that","He was the Son of God."]],[1411,["It was impossible for people to believe Son","of God."]],[1417,["Imagine! Is He Son of God?"]],[1420,["What makes Him that?"]],[1424,["His resurrection proved it."]],[1428,["Till then nobody believed Him."]],[1433,["His disciples never believed Him."]],[1436,["He looked like a very ordinary person, carpenter’s","son, having hardly two robes to wear, living"]],[1445,["in a very poor condition."]],[1449,["What made Him feel that He was the Son of","God?"]],[1456,["His own knowledge about Himself."]],[1461,["Now supposing, somebody is the Son of God,","what should He do to prove it to human beings"]],[1468,["are just like walls?"]],[1469,["Sometimes I find I am talking to walls, absolutely,","or to some people are looking this side, that"]],[1476,["side, and they are not understanding what","I am talking."]],[1479,["How are we to prove that He was the Son of","God?"]],[1486,["It’s an impossibility."]],[1487,["And if He was born in modern times He would","have been crucified only when He was five"]],[1496,["years of age I can tell you! Because now we","are so ego-oriented."]],[1501,["That time people were stupid but now we think","we are very intelligent: “We know everything!"]],[1506,["We know God."]],[1507,["We can organise Him!” There are many who","say that, “We don’t believe in God."]],[1514,["We have created this world."]],[1517,["We are the scientists."]],[1518,["We are this.\""]],[1520,["Oh God! In this mad world, thank God He was","not born, otherwise He would have been crucified"]],[1529,["much earlier."]],[1530,["So, was is impossible to convince at the time","that He was Son of God, but today we can prove"]],[1547,["it! Because at that time human beings had","not reached that stage that they could be"]],[1552,["given Realisation."]],[1553,["Today, Realisation is working en-masse."]],[1557,["Even in England we have now quite a lot of","people: “Even in England,” and I say."]],[1568,["England itself is really a great country."]],[1571,["It’s the heart of the universe."]],[1573,["It’s the greatest country, as far as the","articulation is concerned."]],[1580,["And the source of all that is good comes from","this country."]],[1590,["But the people, English people, have lost","their self-esteem completely I feel sometimes,"]],[1597,["the way they copy French and Americans and","things like that."]],[1603,["If they could have their self-esteem, I still","say that the English youth are the best in"]],[1611,["the whole world."]],[1612,["Surprisingly in my own experience I found","that they are the best."]],[1619,["But rather difficult nuts to be cracked! If","they are cracked they are the best."]],[1626,["And once they are there they sort it out because","they understand."]],[1632,["They are very scholarly."]],[1634,["I think by temperament that they understand","when I say, “You cannot pay money for that.\""]],[1643,["You cannot organise God, and something has","to happen within you."]],[1648,["Some actualisation has to take place."]],[1651,["This is what you should understand if you","are really an Englishman."]],[1656,["Because anything stupid and illogical should","be shunned completely."]],[1667,["Now what is the transformation takes place","[is] that, when this Kundalini rises, She"]],[1672,["passes through these different centres which","are already exhausted within us."]],[1678,["For example the second centre that is within","us is the centre for our activity."]],[1692,["Supposing, you think too much, your brains","cells are to be replaced."]],[1701,["This poor little centre has to work very hard","to replace those cells in your brain."]],[1713,["It starts working a bit too hard and neglects","all other duties it has to do."]],[1719,["For example, it has to look after the liver,","the spleen, the pancreas, the kidneys and"]],[1728,["the uterus."]],[1732,["But when people indiscriminately just go on","thinking like mad — even thinking about"]],[1740,["God — what is it?"]],[1744,["It’s like, as I told you, not coming to","Newbury and just thinking about it."]],[1748,["It’s that mad."]],[1750,["Then this centre it gets so tired, and so","tired, it’s so exhausted that diseases like"]],[1765,["diabetes, liver and other complications, even","[the] blood centre of this spleen can be so"]],[1778,["crazy with this kind of activity that one","can develop blood cancer."]],[1783,["For example, now we are supposed to be running","a rat race."]],[1789,["I mean we are supposed to be."]],[1790,["We are in a race somehow."]],[1792,["Everybody is in a race."]],[1794,["Whether it is in the modern race or in any","other race: we have to belong to a cult or"]],[1801,["some sort of a group where everybody is running","a race, you see."]],[1805,["In that racing we forget about the way we","eat our food, then we rush about."]],[1815,["We don’t even give rest to our different","organs as it is required to balance its activities,"]],[1825,["[so] what happens that a thing like spleen","get so upset, it’s so upset, that it does"]],[1837,["not know when to create more blood cells and","when not to create."]],[1840,["You are eating your food suddenly a telephone","call comes in, you have to get the telephone."]],[1846,["There’s a little child crying, you are looking","after the child."]],[1848,["Now you have to go to the office just leave","your food halfway or whatever you have eaten"]],[1854,["and you just rush out."]],[1855,["You run to the bus and the bus is missing","so you run to another bus."]],[1859,["All this madness make this poor spleen really","mad because it does not understand what to"]],[1868,["do, how to supply the new blood cells, and","the result is you develop blood cancer."]],[1877,["It’s a very simple reason why people develop","blood cancer."]],[1882,["And then blood cancer we say is curable through","Sahaja Yoga."]],[1888,["It is."]],[1891,["Actually cancer does not settle in to people","who are realised."]],[1897,["But it’s absolutely curable through Sahaj","Yoga."]],[1902,["All kinds of cancers can be cured through","Sahaj Yoga, no doubt, but we are not here"]],[1907,["to cure people."]],[1909,["Only those who are seekers the Divine is interested","in."]],[1918,["You will be surprised, a very rich man, I","would say one of the wealthiest men from India,"]],[1927,["brought somebody to be cured and I said, “I","am sorry Sir, I cannot cure this person.\""]],[1936,["And he said, “Why not?"]],[1939,["If you cure I’ll build a hospital for you,","I can give an Ashram for you.\""]],[1943,["I said, “You may do whatever you like, but","I am sorry he cannot be cured.\""]],[1951,["I did not tell him the reason for that, but","the reason is this: this man has exploited"]],[1957,["many people, he’s tortured his wife, he’s","tortured his children."]],[1960,["He’s a horrible fellow."]],[1963,["He has never sought anything good."]],[1970,["He has no compassion."]],[1972,["He has no love."]],[1974,["He’s for himself, a very selfish and a tyrannical","person."]],[1977,["Tomorrow if Hitler comes and say, “Mother,","you give me Realisation.\""]],[1982,["Do you think Divine is supposed to give him","Realisation, because he thinks no end of himself?"]],[1988,["It is for the Divine to decide for you."]],[1995,["It is not for you to decide for the Divine."]],[1999,["The Divine has to say that you are all right."]],[2002,["It’s just the other way round."]],[2005,["Because you may do whatever you like."]],[2008,["You may think that you must get all the blessings","from God, but God has to know that whether"]],[2017,["He is going to be gracious on you or not."]],[2022,["Even His anger is His graciousness."]],[2023,["Because that is what you deserve and through","His anger and wrath He is going to cure you"]],[2031,["and improve you."]],[2033,["Sometimes we have wrong ideas also about our","seeking."]],[2038,["The seeking comes to us from the third centre","which is in the navel."]],[2045,["We call as ‘Nabhi Chakra’."]],[2048,["Is the navel point."]],[2051,["But it’s all in the spinal cord."]],[2054,["Now this third centre is the centre which","gives us seeking from the very beginning when"]],[2063,["we were amoeba."]],[2064,["We started seeking food then, as we became","higher and higher and higher in our seeking"]],[2073,["of food, we became human beings, then we started","seeking say, money, position, power, fame."]],[2083,["Then the spiritual seeking came: we started","seeking in religions outside us, organising"]],[2094,["religions, calling God, devotion, dedication,","but nothing worked out."]],[2102,["So we started a deeper seeking, meditating."]],[2106,["At this time also, people came down from all","over the world to teach you meditation."]],[2115,["Now meditation cannot be taught, it’s a","happening, when you are in meditation."]],[2124,["You cannot go to meditation: it’s not like","a small little house or a temple or a building"]],[2133,["where you can enter into."]],[2135,["It’s a happening."]],[2137,["You are pushed into it."]],[2141,["You just become in meditation."]],[2144,["And this happening take place only when this","Kundalini pierces this fontanel bone area"]],[2154,["and you get an actual baptism — actual,","not artificial."]],[2160,["You can see with your naked eyes, the pulsation","of this Kundalini, the rising of this Kundalini"]],[2170,["and also the pulsation on the head here, till","it stops and you start feeling the cool breeze"]],[2179,["coming simultaneously."]],[2182,["That should happen to you; otherwise don’t","believe in any tall stories."]],[2190,["For which you cannot pay."]],[2195,["For which you cannot think."]],[2200,["For which you cannot organise."]],[2205,["You cannot put in any effort."]],[2207,["It has to happen spontaneously."]],[2211,["So the question comes in: how?"]],[2214,["How it happens?"]],[2216,["It’s all in, in there."]],[2221,["It’s your own, within yourself."]],[2225,["But say there’s a light, say this is a candle","which has got a wick which has got a wax,"]],[2234,["it’s just ready to be enlightened."]],[2236,["Then what you do?"]],[2239,["You take one enlightened candle and bring","it nearer the other and you get the results,"]],[2247,["finished."]],[2248,["What do you do?"]],[2250,["The enlightened candle just acts as a catalytic","agent, and enlightens the another candle without"]],[2261,["any effort, without any trouble."]],[2264,["In the same way an enlightened person can","enlighten another person."]],[2271,["It’s very simple."]],[2274,["But that person has to be enlightened."]],[2276,["And the enlightened person must know how to","maintain your enlightenment for the time being."]],[2291,["Like a seed you sprout: now the children may","sprout the seeds and they would not know what"]],[2299,["do with it."]],[2300,["But a gardener knows: which sprouts the seed,","then it takes all the saplings separately,"]],[2310,["looks after it, allows it to grow, then again","puts it in the soil properly, watches for"]],[2320,["its growth till it comes to its maturity."]],[2325,["He looks after it."]],[2326,["In the same way the person who enlightened","should be able to guide you up to that point."]],[2333,["Such a person is called as ‘guru’ in Sanskrit","language but he has to be a guru who should"]],[2341,["be able to raise your Kundalini."]],[2343,["Because these days if you say the name of","‘guru’, horrible names and horrible faces"]],[2349,["start coming before me and they are not gurus","they are just like satanic forces."]],[2354,["They are horrible people."]],[2356,["How can they be a guru, those who live on","your money: parasites of the worst type! You"]],[2365,["should see that."]],[2366,["I mean, if I ask you come and live with me,","for no money at all, will you accept such"]],[2371,["a situation?"]],[2374,["And these are even worse."]],[2376,["And much worse than any dog, I would say."]],[2380,["Even the dog eats food at your house at least","looks after your house! This is only one way"]],[2389,["traffic."]],[2390,["You have to go on giving them money, money,","money, money, becoming poorer and poorer and"]],[2398,["what do you get?"]],[2400,["Nothing! You must see their lifestyle, it’s","absurd."]],[2405,["They live on your money, they have all the","weaknesses that a scoundrel can have and after"]],[2414,["few years you find they’ll land up in the","prison."]],[2418,["Already we have problems with the prison."]],[2419,["So don’t allow any of those gurus come down","here."]],[2423,["Where will you put them?"]],[2426,["Like in Switzerland I went and saw one gentleman","there."]],[2432,["He told me that, “There’s a horrible guru","who lives here."]],[2435,["Mother please come and just pay attention","to his ashram.\""]],[2438,["I said, “All right.\""]],[2440,["I went with him in his car, and looked at","the place: a huge lavish place he has created"]],[2446,["for himself, with very tall walls like a big","palace! And you could see from outside the"]],[2457,["amount of money this fellow must have gathered."]],[2462,["And within eight days a nurse fell in love","with a policeman, and this nurse was the private"]],[2472,["secretary of this guru who had used that nurse","to poison some oranges to kill some people."]],[2484,["And so the guru, the great, now is in jail","for 14 years."]],[2492,["All such horrid people what have they got","to do with Divine?"]],[2501,["But they mesmerise, and once you are mesmerised","your seeking becomes absolutely stupid and"]],[2508,["foolish."]],[2509,["You cannot see you are mesmerised."]],[2513,["You cannot understand how you are mesmerised."]],[2516,["You don’t want anything for yourself."]],[2518,["There’s another one who was coming here","the other day, and he said that, “If you"]],[2524,["give me a Rolls Royce I’ll come.\""]],[2527,["Imagine! He was to come from America."]],[2530,["He had already got 58 Rolls Royce from you","people, from you, the English, very wise."]],[2538,["I must say the wisest people in the whole","world, have given 58 Rolls Royces to this"]],[2545,["14 year old fellow! Now he has become yankee","in America, taken away all your money, befooling"]],[2552,["you."]],[2553,["He has 58 Rolls Royces, he wants 59th."]],[2556,["I don’t know why he wants one more."]],[2558,["Poor boys and girls, they don’t have so","much money now."]],[2564,["Here the young people don’t have much money."]],[2567,["Like in our country maybe rich people’s","children get a lot of money, but here I find"]],[2572,["that the young people have to find their own","way."]],[2575,["They starved themselves, ate only potatoes","and fasted, did all kinds of things to save"]],[2582,["money to buy a Rolls Royce for this scoundrel,","just think of it! These are all seekers who"]],[2591,["did it."]],[2592,["So foolish and stupid! And when he came they","presented him with this Rolls Royce."]],[2601,["My heart really weeps and I really don’t","know what to say to this kind of foolishness"]],[2605,["people are doing."]],[2606,["Naturally your parents do not believe in you!","They think: what stupidity you are doing?"]],[2615,["I can understand."]],[2617,["Even if they doubt me, I wouldn’t mind,","because really this kind of stupidity you"]],[2622,["have done."]],[2623,["And how can you believe such stupid fellow","who asked for a Rolls Royce?"]],[2627,["You should have really given him a toy Rolls","Royce and 3, 4 slaps on the face and he would"]],[2633,["gone back."]],[2634,["That’s what he deserves."]],[2635,["Now he got this Rolls Royce very nicely, he","cheated you all and went back."]],[2641,["And he’ll come back next year and you will","be again doing the same thing for him!"]],[2649,["Now when some of the Sahaja Yogis went and","asked these people that, “Why did you do"]],[2653,["it?” They said, “He has given us something","so great."]],[2656,["This is metal."]],[2658,["If we give him the metal and if he gives us","the Spirit why not do it?” It’s foolishness!"]],[2666,["Can you get Spirit for giving some metal?"]],[2670,["Can you?"]],[2671,["Spirit, can you purchase it or could exchange","it?"]],[2678,["But","from where this kind of stupidity walks into"]],[2687,["your heads?"]],[2688,["I mean you are not such stupid people."]],[2690,["Most of them are educated in university: Oxford,","Cambridge."]],[2692,["Did you learn all these stupidity there?"]],[2697,["No! It’s some sort of a mesmerism I feel."]],[2701,["Some stupid spirits have entered into their","minds."]],[2705,["That’s the only solution I can get."]],[2708,["I cannot understand what is the reason for","these people to go about buying Rolls Royces"]],[2716,["for their gurus."]],[2717,["Then another guru comes up here and tells","you, “I will make you fly.\""]],[2723,["Very big, big people are out to fly."]],[2726,["But why do you want to fly?"]],[2728,["Do you want to become birds?"]],[2732,["Have you to become birds now?"]],[2737,["You have to become a superior human being,","with superior value systems, built within"]],[2743,["you."]],[2744,["You want to fly."]],[2746,["I mean it is stupidity."]],[2747,["Even if somebody gives you ideas like that,","better ask him to fly himself, drop him from"]],[2754,["this leaning tower of Pisa and see where does","he lie, which part."]],[2760,["Why do you believe such stupid things, I can’t","understand."]],[2764,["You are supposed to be English."]],[2766,["I mean at least Indians have great ideas about","your brains."]],[2770,["H."]],[2771,["G."]],[2772,["Wells has said that English will have one","day having only heads and no bodies."]],[2775,["But I don’t think that’s going to happen","with the advent of all these stupid gurus"]],[2780,["coming here and you people passing out all","your money to them."]],[2784,["I don’t know what is going to happen."]],[2786,["As it is we are suffering from so many other","things, plus this kind of a nonsense coming"]],[2792,["all the spirits coming down."]],[2794,["All this negativity working into us I don’t","know what is going to happen to this country"]],[2800,["of ours."]],[2801,["I don’t know."]],[2802,["I can’t understand."]],[2804,["Now everybody is meditating in this country,","trying to fly."]],[2809,["Imagine! Doing nothing, sitting at home, meditating:","lethargy of the worst type! Trying to fly."]],[2818,["This is what it is."]],[2820,["That’s what has happened to our seeking","in various ways, in this way or that way or"]],[2825,["that way."]],[2826,["No, this is not to happen anymore, enough","of it."]],[2828,["You must get your Realisation."]],[2829,["That’s what you have to have."]],[2833,["The Kundalini has to rise and you have to","get it because you are seekers of ages, ancient"]],[2841,["times."]],[2842,["You are born today, here, to get your Realisation."]],[2845,["That’s your right to have it, and not to","be befooled by these people who just come"]],[2851,["here and exploit you and have floated a market","and enterprises."]],[2856,["Now this Kundalinis thing comes to you through","that centre."]],[2861,["When it comes to awakening centre, that centre","of your seeking."]],[2870,["Then you start seeing what you are seeking."]],[2878,["You are seeking the joy of your Spirit, the","bliss of peace within yourself."]],[2886,["When the Kundalini rises and shoots off, the","seeking is complete because you have found"]],[2899,["it: you are just there, no questions."]],[2905,["Supposing you enlighten the light then what","does the light do?"]],[2910,["First, she is asking for the light, all right,","“I must have the light."]],[2913,["I must have the light,” [then] she gives","light — finished."]],[2918,["Then you don’t sit there, you sit here with","me and you give vibrations to people, you"]],[2923,["raise their Kundalinis, you awaken them and","give them Realisation."]],[2926,["Yes, it happens."]],[2927,["You all have those powers."]],[2932,["In a split of a second you get that and you","become that."]],[2938,["That’s your style [because] you are human","beings, you are not worms."]],[2944,["You are created out of the billions and billions","of creatures, special ones, the chosen ones,"]],[2956,["to bestow this bliss upon you so that you","enter into the Kingdom of your Father, the"]],[2965,["God Almighty, and enjoy your being and that’s","what you are."]],[2971,["Why are you wasting and frittering away your","energy on these nonsensical people?"]],[2975,["Pay attention to yourself."]],[2979,["Just find out what you are."]],[2980,["It’s a very easy thing: it should happen","to you."]],[2985,["It has happened to so many in this country","and should happen to people in Newbury."]],[2991,["It is Cathy who has brought me here."]],[2994,["Actually now I am on my way to India and you","had this idea not to go out of London, because"]],[3004,["I have really travelling too much in Europe."]],[3005,["Of course, I must say Europeans are also very","sensible people: they can see through now."]],[3008,["But I think you have to go through all that","otherwise you would have never understood"]],[3014,["the value of Sahaj Yoga."]],[3016,["Perhaps that was necessary for them to spend","a lot of money on these gurus and to suffer"]],[3023,["from all kinds of diseases."]],[3024,["There are some here sitting, from there only","suffering from epilepsy and all kinds of horrible"]],[3030,["diseases like blood cancer."]],[3031,["They are here, some of them sitting."]],[3032,["Then you will realise the value of Sahaja","Yoga which gives you bliss, joy and happiness."]],[3040,["First of all it gives you the physical well","being."]],[3045,["It just gives you the physical well being."]],[3049,["Like any place where God has to be brought","in, you clean that place."]],[3055,["So the Kundalini cleanses your physical being."]],[3060,["That’s how you get your diseases cured."]],[3063,["Cancer is very simple, extremely simple, to","be cured, very simple to be cured."]],[3070,["But for doctors it is impossible to accept","that there is God, in the real sense of the"]],[3076,["word."]],[3077,["Ah, they will have a photograph of Christ","in the house."]],[3079,["They might wear a cross, you see, that’s","at the most."]],[3083,["But to believe that you can cure cancer through","Divine power is an impossibility for them."]],[3094,["But we have some doctors also here."]],[3097,["But if they come to me they think they are","all mad."]],[3099,["Cancer is a simple disease."]],[3101,["Now they have reached a point where they are","coming nearer to Sahaj Yoga."]],[3107,["On the left hand side and the right hand side","we have certain areas, and now they are talking"]],[3116,["about these areas which exist within us and","they say there is an attack from these areas"]],[3122,["which are built within us from the time of","our creation, and these areas have those deposits"]],[3133,["and they send forth some protein matter, which","we cannot identify otherwise, which might"]],[3141,["have gone out of circulation of evolution."]],[3145,["When they attack us cancer is triggered."]],[3148,["And now this I have said at least ten years","back."]],[3151,["I have been saying that there are entities","who enter into us."]],[3157,["’Us’ meaning the central path, the middle","path, the middle road."]],[3164,["They come from the sides and attack us."]],[3168,["But actually when we go to the extremes of","the left or to the right, we ourselves become"]],[3174,["vulnerable and we are attacked and that’s","how cancer is set in."]],[3179,["So down below is the hell, the left side is","the collective subconscious, the right side"]],[3186,["is the collective supraconscious, which is","the future side of it."]],[3191,["In the top is the Divine Power, which is the","superconsciousness we can call it, or the"]],[3200,["collective unconscious as they call it, which","becomes conscious as soon as the Kundalini"]],[3206,["touches it."]],[3208,["Your attention goes there and the whole thing","is lifted just like the tent being lifted"]],[3214,["up, and you find that nothing can enter into","your attention anymore."]],[3223,["You are in that area where you cannot get","attacked."]],[3225,["And this is what has happened to you, to many","of you, and is going to happen to the rest"]],[3236,["of the people who have come here for the first","time."]],[3240,["I must say, Newbury, I must find out about","it much more, because I find this place has"]],[3247,["tremendous vibrations."]],[3249,["Only when our car arrived here I asked them,","“Where is the water somewhere here?” I"]],[3255,["was not dousing but I can feel vibrations","of the water somewhere."]],[3259,["And the place has tremendous vibrations."]],[3262,["Actually I was thinking, “How am I going","to speak?” because as soon as I reached"]],[3270,["this place my whole body started emitting","all kinds of energies from the body and I"]],[3276,["was really very much worried as to, “What’s","going to happen now?"]],[3280,["What am I going to speak?” But this has","worked out and I hope you have been able to"]],[3288,["understand it."]],[3289,["Now for the rest of the details you just don’t","worry."]],[3297,["We have all the books and everything for your","information which you can read later on."]],[3302,["It’s is a simple thing, like coming in the","room, you ask me how to put on the lights."]],[3309,["I have to just tell you, “Just press the","switch and it will be on.\""]],[3314,["In the same way everything is built within","you, you don’t have to do anything about"]],[3319,["it."]],[3320,["It will work out in no time."]],[3323,["But once it is worked out then you [should]","try to understand it, what it is, and try"]],[3328,["to maintain it for a while."]],[3330,["And you will be amazed that, here in Newbury,","you can start a centre of your own of Sahaj"]],[3338,["Yoga, giving Realisation to many people."]],[3341,["May God bless you! Thank you."]],[3344,["If you have any questions you can ask me."]],[3351,["Yes, please."]],[3354,["Man: Yeah I have got a question okay."]],[3363,["Earlier on you were going on about if you","have family, children, and such as, who interrupt"]],[3367,["you and the telephone."]],[3368,["What were you trying to say?"]],[3372,["Do you want us just ignore this?"]],[3373,["Shri Mataji: Oh, not at all! If you are not","married you cannot get Realisation."]],[3377,["Man: Then what do you mean by this?"]],[3378,["I tend to think you are you trying to say","that you must try and ignore household attractions"]],[3384,["and this…"]],[3385,["Shri Mataji: When did I say that?"]],[3389,["Man: I don’t quite know."]],[3392,["I had a job to hear everything you say but…"]],[3398,["Shri Mataji: No, no, no! Who said that?"]],[3403,["Not at all!"]],[3405,["Man: What did you mean when you say, “The","telephone rings..\""]],[3411,["What do you mean, “You must suddenly stop","and answer the telephone,” but what do you"]],[3421,["mean?"]],[3422,["Yogini: Mother, it’s when you were talking","about the spleen."]],[3424,["You said that the trouble is that there are","so many distractions that the spleen can’t"]],[3428,["handle it, and I think he’s misunderstood","you."]],[3429,["Man: Yeah, that’s right."]],[3430,["Shri Mataji: Ah! No, no, no, you should only","look after your child and not the telephone,"]],[3433,["I was meaning."]],[3434,["You must have your priorities properly built","up."]],[3435,["Ours are not."]],[3436,["What I was trying to say a child is lying","there, you are eating your food, a telephone"]],[3439,["is coming, now you have to rush out, the child","is neglected, you run away, you are worried"]],[3445,["about the child — never that [what you were","suggesting]."]],[3448,["You don’t know in Sahaja Yoga you have to","be married."]],[3450,["There’s a centre of marriage."]],[3452,["You will be amazed."]],[3453,["If you are a so called ascetic, I can’t","give you Realisation."]],[3456,["Another man: You can’t what?"]],[3459,["Shri Mataji: You can’t get your Realisation","if you are an ascetic."]],[3464,["So called."]],[3465,["Asceticism is within yourself."]],[3467,["A person like Guru Nanaka and all these great","people they were all married people."]],[3473,["It doesn’t mean that you have to give up","your family at all."]],[3476,["On the contrary, we have to have families,","beautiful families and beautiful children"]],[3482,["and we are having Sahaja Yoga marriages."]],[3484,["Do you know there are three or four couples","here who were married through Sahaj Yoga."]],[3489,["And they are beautiful people, they have beautiful","children."]],[3492,["And moreover I must tell you a greater news:","that there are lots of realised-souls who"]],[3499,["are born in this country."]],[3502,["And you have to be married so that they are","born to you also."]],[3506,["Now this child is a realised-soul, she is","sitting, towards me."]],[3511,["To be sitting that quietly is not possible","unless and until they are realised."]],[3517,["This Alison is born-realised."]],[3518,["Man: My children, my three children: They","are not realised and they are sitting here"]],[3519,["all quiet!"]],[3520,["Shri Mataji: Who?"]],[3521,["Man: My children, my 3 children, they are","not realised so you are taking…"]],[3523,["Shri Mataji: How do you know?"]],[3524,["Let me see where are they?"]],[3525,["Man: One, two, three."]],[3526,["Shri Mataji: They must be born-realised, I","am sure."]],[3527,["Man: They are not! They are not!"]],[3528,["Shri Mataji: How do you know?"]],[3530,["How do you know?"]],[3533,["We’ll tell them."]],[3535,["How do you know?"]],[3538,["You don’t know, you are not yet realised","but they are, must be I am sure, 100%."]],[3545,["Man: Well it seems that anything you say,","goes."]],[3550,["Shri Mataji: We’ll teach you how to know."]],[3552,["We’ll teach you how to know."]],[3553,["You should get your Realisation."]],[3554,["Where are they?"]],[3555,["I would love to see them."]],[3556,["I can’t see them."]],[3557,["Man: But they are quiet all the time."]],[3558,["I say it’s instinct."]],[3559,["Shri Mataji: Come along, come, come."]],[3561,["They must be born-realised to be quiet like","that."]],[3564,["I would like to see them."]],[3565,["I am sure."]],[3566,["How would you know their value?"]],[3567,["I would love to see them."]],[3569,["Oh that, she is realised 100%."]],[3573,["Are you doubting her Realisation?"]],[3578,["She is born-realised."]],[3580,["She is born as a realised-soul."]],[3581,["She is born-realised, no doubt."]],[3583,["I mean I knew, I was going to ask about her."]],[3587,["How do you know?"]],[3589,["You are a great person to have three children","born-realised, I must say."]],[3592,["For example, the little one there is a born-realised","and the little in that corner is a born-realised."]],[3597,["And there are many born-realised people, also","there are people who are there."]],[3599,["Where is Alan is he there?"]],[3600,["Man: It’s just natural it doesn’t need","a big word for it, does it!"]],[3604,["Shri Mataji: They are born-realised because","they got their Realisation in their previous"]],[3608,["lives."]],[3609,["It is a very big thing for people who are","not realised."]],[3612,["Man: What do they know about previous lives?"]],[3615,["They don’t know anything about previous","lives."]],[3617,["Shri Mataji: That’s what I am going to tell","them."]],[3619,["That’s why I am here."]],[3621,["They are born because I am here."]],[3624,["Do you know that?"]],[3625,["I am going to tell them what it is."]],[3627,["See these, these are all born-realised [those]","two people [who] are coming."]],[3632,["Ask them about it."]],[3633,["I never gave them Realisation they are born-realised","but I gave them the knowledge about what they"]],[3638,["are."]],[3639,["(Sit down my child, sit down.) They are all","realised-souls, no doubt about it! Not [just]"]],[3643,["realised-souls but they could be very great","souls born on this Earth."]],[3650,["It is not [that] they are quiet because they","are told to be."]],[3653,["If they were not realised-souls they would","have run away."]],[3657,["They would not have been sitting because they","are enjoying it."]],[3660,["Their Spirit is enjoying it."]],[3663,["You will know it very soon."]],[3664,["Man: They will sit quietly anywhere!"]],[3666,["Shri Mataji: No, no, they might because they","are realised-souls."]],[3669,["Man: No, it doesn’t mean they are realised-souls,","it just means they are children."]],[3673,["Shri Mataji: They are very different types","of children, very different type, something"]],[3677,["so unique."]],[3678,["Once you get your Realisation you will start","seeing their beauty much better."]],[3681,["Oh! They know such a lot you can’t imagine."]],[3684,["My four grandchildren are born-realised but","my own daughters were not."]],[3686,["What am I to do?"]],[3688,["And four of them are great people, but my","own daughters were not."]],[3697,["What to do?"]],[3701,["They are born-realised."]],[3703,["You will see that."]],[3705,["They are that."]],[3706,["You should be a proud man."]],[3708,["But you better get your Realisation, all right."]],[3712,["I am happy you are so concerned about your","children."]],[3715,["I am very happy."]],[3716,["May God bless you."]],[3717,["Any other questions?"]],[3718,["Seeker: I am very impressed with what you","said about Christ having done thinking for"]],[3725,["us and we ourselves are trying to think too","much."]],[3730,["Isn’t there a danger, if we all become child-like","trusters, that we could be exploited?"]],[3746,["Shri Mataji: Yes, it is a danger, of course."]],[3751,["I mean you are already exploited 100%."]],[3753,["There is a danger, no doubt."]],[3755,["I have already told you about the danger."]],[3758,["But to become child-like is not easy."]],[3760,["You can be befooled but to be child-like is","the best thing."]],[3765,["Innocence is the most powerful thing."]],[3767,["If you are innocent nobody can touch you."]],[3773,["But very difficult to be innocent."]],[3776,["The centre of innocence has to be awakened","within us, then you will be like children."]],[3782,["Now would you say that Christ was exploited,","many people feel that way that He was exploited:"]],[3790,["no! It was all planned very well."]],[3793,["He just played a drama."]],[3794,["Such people do not suffer."]],[3797,["I do not suffer, never."]],[3798,["Even if I say that I am suffering it’s just","a joke."]],[3802,["Never take that seriously."]],[3805,["It’s a drama."]],[3806,["Such people don’t suffer."]],[3809,["He never suffered, in the sense you understand","suffering."]],[3813,["Of course, with the physical body you do feel","little pain here and there."]],[3818,["But you just see it as a witness."]],[3826,["You are not really in it."]],[3828,["And when you become that, yourself, a witness,","nobody can exploit you."]],[3834,["Because what happens you develop a new type","of a dimension, an awareness, which is called"]],[3841,["as vibratory awareness."]],[3842,["By this enlightenment of your fingers you","become collectively conscious."]],[3846,["Immediately you know who is who, what is what."]],[3853,["Children know it, those who are realised-souls","specially know it."]],[3856,["Any funny man comes in they start crying and","weeping."]],[3859,["Like this girl’s father and mother were","involved in a nonsense."]],[3863,["They are here now."]],[3866,["Both suffered a lot the mother became epileptic","and all that."]],[3871,["And this child used to scream whenever she","saw their revered guru, and she used to shout"]],[3879,["and resist and she used to kick him."]],[3883,["She is just a child but she knew how to protect."]],[3885,["And these people with all their intelligence","and education and this and that, were absolutely"]],[3893,["useless! Because you develop that new awareness","within you by which you can feel a person,"]],[3898,["you know."]],[3899,["You cannot be exploited."]],[3900,["All right."]],[3901,["That has to happen to you."]],[3908,["That’s a happening."]],[3911,["Such a powerful personality develops, such","a powerful personality."]],[3916,["That way, many of our Sahaj Yogis also think","that I am a quite an innocent person, I mean"]],[3923,["they think so, but now they know I know everything."]],[3926,["I may look such a fool, but I am not."]],[3932,["And the powerfulness is such, that first the","compassion, the compassion itself is so powerful,"]],[3941,["so engulfing, it’s so rewarding."]],[3943,["Then you are not bothered about anyone."]],[3945,["What are they going to do to you?"]],[3949,["Like in India when I started, right and left","criticising, all these gurus, taking their"]],[3955,["names."]],[3956,["I started saying, “Now these people are","like this."]],[3959,["These people, they are making money and befooling","you.\""]],[3962,["Some of the guru’s people, who were [become]","Sahaja Yogis, one of them was some Raja or"]],[3968,["some place, he came to me and said, “Mother,","what are you doing?"]],[3972,["They will kill You.\""]],[3973,["I said, “This time let them try killing","me! Who is going to kill me, I’ll see?"]],[3978,["That was done once for all."]],[3981,["Now let me see who is going to kill me.\""]],[3984,["I said, “Let them lift their hands towards","me, if they can they’ll shake."]],[3989,["They cannot kill me.\""]],[3991,["It’s the most powerful thing is your innocence","which we have lost sometimes foolishly."]],[4001,["It is the highest thing."]],[4004,["And nobody can exploit an innocent person,","nobody can befool."]],[4009,["You have seen simple village folk, how do","they exist with all the cunning of the very"]],[4015,["well educated and sophisticated people, how","do they exist?"]],[4020,["They can manage them just like this (clicks","Her fingers) And you must see the intentions"]],[4030,["of the person: why a person should exploit,","what is the need of the person."]],[4041,["People don’t even see the credibility of","a personality who comes here."]],[4045,["It’s very surprising."]],[4046,["Like one guru came here."]],[4048,["I would say, it’s something, another foolishness","who was living in a tin shed, that is what"]],[4056,["Peter told me in South Africa, and thousands","and thousands of people are his disciples."]],[4064,["To such an extent you will be surprised."]],[4066,["I mean, I don’t know what to say, this is","complete blindness."]],[4074,["I went to Norwich, so far away."]],[4077,["This fellow has come to London only."]],[4079,["And I met three elderly ladies who were his","disciples and this gentleman was later on"]],[4088,["found to be having whisky every night and","using women, and he had all kinds of things."]],[4096,["And his private secretary herself disclosed","everything about him."]],[4103,["And then they found it out and they verified","it."]],[4106,["But these three foolish women still said,","“Whatever it is Mother we cannot give him"]],[4112,["up, we love him.\""]],[4113,["Now what to do to with such stupid women?"]],[4116,["You just tell me."]],[4118,["I mean the question of you also wanting to","get exploited! I mean he is exposed, everybody"]],[4126,["knows about it, this gentleman about whom","I told you who was asking for a Rolls Royce,"]],[4134,["was caught for smuggling three hundred watches","in India."]],[4138,["I mean how can a man like that be interested","in smuggling?"]],[4142,["Just think of that! But all these people who","carried those watches went to the police and"]],[4149,["said, “We brought it for ourselves.\""]],[4151,["Three hundred watches this fellow was carrying!","And they would not give in."]],[4161,["And when he went to jail, they put a big show,","and the Indian government did not know what"]],[4168,["to do so they said, “All right you take","him away."]],[4171,["We don’t want to keep him in jail that otherwise","your government will come and say why our"]],[4176,["three hundred Britishers are arrested,”","imagine! So they sent all the bad lock, stock"]],[4182,["and barrel back."]],[4186,["So he came back here."]],[4188,["From here he has gone to America."]],[4191,["Now if you don’t want to see: I mean, isn’t","it clear cut what I said?"]],[4197,["So clear cut."]],[4198,["If you don’t want to see it what can you","do?"]],[4201,["I mean I tell you, sometimes I feel it is","the people who want to get exploited or they"]],[4206,["don’t want to see it."]],[4208,["Now I would like one of them to speak to you","it would be a good idea."]],[4213,["Because you will know how he was caught and","how he was disillusioned."]],[4218,["Peter (Pierce)?"]],[4219,["Is he there, just tell him."]],[4222,["So you will know how he was befooled."]],[4225,["He was supposed to be a great, he is, he was,","a great diamond merchant from South Africa;"]],[4234,["married a granddaughter of a Duke of your","country, and that the granddaughter is also"]],[4241,["here."]],[4242,["Peter?"]],[4243,["Where is he?"]],[4244,["Peter?"]],[4245,["I would like you to tell them what happened","with you and how you got exploited."]],[4251,["That would be a better idea."]],[4253,["You have it from your own kith and kin."]],[4256,["Just tell them."]]]);
